'mai_SMTP_port_authenticate' => '(en)Smtp port %u allow client to authenticate:',
'mai_SMTP_port_(25)' => '(en)Smtp port (25) main purpose is to receive emails from another server, starttls is always offered, but auth if offered is only if starttls is also used by client.',
'mai_SMTP_Submission' => '(en)Smtp submission port (587) will require starttls, then authenticate to send.',
